OL,3,GNEWSAFire-ravaged reserve still records
OL,4,A50C temperatures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ground at a nature reserve that was
OL,7,Fravaged during a huge wildfire in the
OL,8,Fsummer is still recording high
OL,9,Ftemperatures almost three months on.
OL,11,FParts of Dunwich Heath and neighbouring
OL,12,FRSPB Minsmere on the Suffolk coast were
OL,13,Fdestroyed during the fire on 29 July,
OL,14,Fand it took the fire service nearly two
OL,15,Fweeks to stand down from the scene.
OL,17,FIt was announced last month that the
OL,18,Fcause could not be determined. Many
OL,19,Fareas of the site still remain
OL,20,Finaccessible as safety tests and
OL,21,Fmonitoring tasks are carried out.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
