OL,3,GNEWSAFire-ravaged reserve still records
OL,4,A50C temperatures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Trust, which owns and
OL,7,Fmanages Dunwich Heath, said it was
OL,8,Fstill recording temperatures of more
OL,9,Fthan 53C in some areas, despite cooler
OL,10,Ftemperatures and rainfall.
